# Committed on purpose, listed here so nobody "tidies" them away:
#   baselines/        the reference scoreboard; the regression gate compares to it
#   cases/            the answer key, reviewed like knowledge
#   personas/         the persona registry cases reference by id
#   fixtures/         agent-response fixtures and the frozen retrieval capture used
#                     by framework tests (fixtures/captured_retrieval/); no corpus
#                     lives here -- the harness evaluates the real knowledge server

